s lÔÇÖinnovation et la recherche en sant├®.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"922\">Nous croyons quÔÇÖun <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"795\">meilleur acc├¿s ├á la connaissance</strong> est un levier essentiel pour am├®liorer les pratiques, renforcer les comp├®tences et contribuer au bien-├¬tre de la population.</p><p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"960\">Explorez, apprenez et partagez.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Contactez nous\n					</a>\n																			<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Acceuil','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2025-09-16 19:26:13','2025-09-16 19:26:13','',10,'http://localhost:8080/?p=26',0,'revision','',0),(30,1,'2025-09-16 21:52:05','2025-09-16 21:52:05','','woocommerce-placeholder','','inherit','open','closed','','woocommerce-placeholder','','','2025-09-16 21:52:05','2025-09-16 21:52:05','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/woocommerce-placeholder.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(31,1,'2025-09-16 21:52:05','2025-09-16 21:52:05','<!-- wp:shortcode -->[woocommerce_cart]<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','','','trash','closed','closed','','31-2__trashed','','','2025-09-17 16:59:59','2025-09-17 16:59:59','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=31',0,'page','',0),(32,1,'2025-09-16 21:52:05','2025-09-16 21:52:05','<!-- wp:shortcode -->[woocommerce_checkout]<!-- /wp:shortcode -->','','','trash','closed','closed','','32-2__trashed','','','2025-09-17 16:59:30','2025-09-17 16:59:30','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=32',0,'page','',0),(33,1,'2025-09-16 21:58:09','2025-09-16 21:58:09','{\"fields\":{\"1\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"name\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"format\":\"simple\",\"description\":\"\",\"required\":\"1\",\"size\":\"large\",\"simple_placeholder\":\"\",\"simple_default\":\"\",\"first_placeholder\":\"\",\"first_default\":\"\",\"middle_placeholder\":\"\",\"middle_default\":\"\",\"las